  "ruleText": "Cla 202.01 Construction of Rules. Cla 202.02 through Cla 215 shall be construed to provide a prompt and impartial determination of claims and challenges to payment or the dismissal of claims.\n\nSource. #2659, eff 3-28-84; EXPIRED 3-28-90\n\nNew. #5481, eff 11-1-92, EXPIRED: 11-1-98\n\nNew. #8509, eff 12-09-05",
